291: ## Cross-subject
292: 
293: Four visual arts rows of grades 6 to 8 carry a cross_subject lean (data/progressions/arts.csv); each is a same-year
294: lean on a core course, each core frame is written, and each teaches its part before this course's unit uses it
295: (art course days map to school days as in the Days bullet: year days 35 to 48 fall on school days 88 to 120, year
296: days 49 to 62 on school days 123 to 155, year days 35 to 50 on school days 88 to 125). All leans are on core courses
297: (lesson 32).
298: 
